   "kind": "decision",
   "text": "Sharp corners: frames, panels, plates and buttons are square with 12px corner ticks (8 on phones); chips and inputs 2px; dots and rings full.",
   "why": "Changed 2026-11-19 from rounded 4/8/16 when the UI direction became a scientific AR overlay (thin lines, ticks, leader lines)."
  },
  {
   "id": "k-glow",
   "kind": "decision",
   "text": "Glow means alive: no glow at rest (a 1px line); hover/focus and active glow in the element's role color; live things glow without a hover (launch button, active rail dot, selected card, scanner lock, Cori speaking, scan complete).",
   "why": "A calmer screen, and a glow always says something."
  },
  {
   "id": "k-lines",
   "kind": "decision",
   "text": "1px borders; 2px only for active and the focus ring. focus-visible: 2px signal ring with 2px offset on every control."
  },
